<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 5,308 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 800 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  213   (178 and 299)</p>
<p>    Good		172   (170 and 135)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     165   (165 and 112)</p>
<p>    Medium	    155   (155 and 106)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	125   (125 and  84)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 213 pence for an Assam PF</p>
</text>
